This repository is part of the Fukuii project. For the main client, see
https://github.com/fukuii-project/fukuii

No upstream corpus is vendored into this repository, and that is the layout decision rather than a
stage it has not reached yet: upstream/ holds pinned submodules, and preserved copies live in the
archive submodule (fukuii-project/archive-reference-material), which carries their licenses and
per-corpus attribution with them. Should material ever be copied in rather than pinned or archived,
its attribution is recorded here at that point.
